---
description: Playwright + TypeScript test conventions for this repo
globs: ["tests/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `AGENTS.md`. Workflows and prompts are in `agents/`.
- Use fixtures from `src/fixtures` (`import { test, expect } from '../../src/fixtures'`), never raw `@playwright/test` in UI/API specs.
- Locators: `getByRole` > `getByLabel`/`getByPlaceholder` > `getByTestId` > `data-*`. Define them in Page Objects only.
- Never use `waitForTimeout`, `networkidle`, `force: true`, or extra retries/timeouts to make a test pass.
- Web-first assertions only: `await expect(locator).toHaveText(...)`.
- Before finishing: `npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run test:chromium`.
